WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.941 --> 00:00:02.339
- [Preston] My parents
said I could be anything,

00:00:02.339 --> 00:00:04.120
so I became a guy.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.912
And when I'm up on stage, I feel like

00:00:06.912 --> 00:00:09.341
this is actually who I am.

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:11.924
(upbeat music)

00:00:18.272 --> 00:00:22.439
My name is Preston Thomas
Martin and I'm a bodybuilder.

00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:26.598
The Trans Bodybuilding
Competition is a bodybuilding

00:00:26.598 --> 00:00:29.614
competition for trans men who are pre-

00:00:29.614 --> 00:00:32.110
or post-op for their top surgery.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.681
It's basically like a comfortable
setting that we can all

00:00:34.681 --> 00:00:37.881
come to, those of us who love fitness.

00:00:37.881 --> 00:00:40.889
This is the third year of the competition

00:00:40.889 --> 00:00:44.149
and it's grown a lot
since it first started.

00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:46.089
There's more competitors,
there's more people

00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:48.271
that are coming out to see it,

00:00:48.271 --> 00:00:49.761
it's just grown bigger and bigger.

00:00:49.761 --> 00:00:51.191
- Quarter turn to the right.

00:00:51.191 --> 00:00:52.540
- [Preston] I've always
watched the national

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.681
professional bodybuilders up
on stage and I'm just like,

00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:58.631
"Aw man, I wanna be there one day."

00:00:58.631 --> 00:01:01.041
And this Trans Bodybuilding Competition

00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:03.881
has done that for trans people.

00:01:03.881 --> 00:01:05.140
This is a comfortable setting for me

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:09.307
to do something that I love
to do and show off. (laughs)

00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:12.449
I came to like bodybuilding because

00:01:12.449 --> 00:01:14.329
I realized that it helped me a lot.

00:01:14.329 --> 00:01:16.551
As far as my mental health goes,

00:01:16.551 --> 00:01:19.311
bodybuilding is like therapy for me.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:22.459
It helps me learn how to calm myself.

00:01:22.459 --> 00:01:27.139
It makes you a stronger
person all the way around.

00:01:27.139 --> 00:01:28.860
After transitioning, my perspective

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.399
on masculinity has changed a lot.

00:01:31.399 --> 00:01:32.860
Even though it's been six years since

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.191
I've been transitioning,
I am still a sweetheart.

00:01:36.191 --> 00:01:40.809
When I look in the mirror
now, I see a strong person,

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:42.819
but I have really had to look at my life

00:01:42.819 --> 00:01:45.007
and everything that I have accomplished

00:01:45.007 --> 00:01:47.039
and everything that I have been through

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:50.190
and been able to come back from.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:53.459
The fact that I am happy
with my transition,

00:01:53.459 --> 00:01:55.380
I'm happy with the way
that I'm turning out

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.658
and the way I'm looking, I'm happy

00:01:56.658 --> 00:01:59.379
with how strong I'm becoming mentally.

00:01:59.379 --> 00:02:01.238
I look in the mirror and
I can't help but smile.

00:02:01.238 --> 00:02:04.571
I get excited. (laughs)

